<http://caressesrobot.org/ontology#hasLikeliness> a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "hasLikeliness"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Likeliness value for conversation topics. It corresponds to a reasonable estimate, to the best of available knowledge, of the a posteriori probability of the assertion. \\n- In the Culture-Specific Layer, Likeliness values are used to specify how appropriate each instance is for the each culture, and guide the robot’s behaviour. \\n- In the Person-Specific Layer, the likeliness corresponds to the evidence of the assertion collected through interaction with the user."^^<http://w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral> ;
    rdfs:domain <http://caressesrobot.org/ontology#Topic> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy onto: ;
